@startuml sequence-payment-process
title Quy trình Thu tiền tại Quầy, Xác minh Chuyển khoản & Sổ Cái Tài chính (Payment Flow)
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam participantPadding 10
skinparam boxPadding 10

actor "Lễ tân / Thu ngân\n(Receptionist / Cashier)" as Cashier
participant "Salon Portal\n(Checkout UI)" as Web
participant "PaymentsController" as Controller
participant "PaymentsService" as Service
participant "PaymentProviderRegistry" as Registry
participant "ManualBankTransferAdapter" as BankAdapter
database "PostgreSQL\n(Prisma ORM)" as DB
participant "SchedulerGateway\n(Socket.IO)" as WsGateway

== 1. Thu tiền Mặt tại Quầy (Cash Payment) ==
Cashier -> Web : Chọn lịch hẹn, kiểm tra tổng tiền & Chọn phương thức "Tiền mặt (CASH)"
Web -> Controller : POST /api/v1/payments\nHeaders: Authorization: Bearer <token>, Idempotency-Key: <UUID>\nBody: { bookingId, amount, method: 'CASH' }

activate Controller
Controller -> Service : createPayment(dto, user)
activate Service

Service -> Registry : resolve('CASH')
activate Registry
Registry --> Service : CashPaymentAdapter (requiresManualVerification: false)
deactivate Registry

Service -> DB : withSerializableTransaction(async (tx) => { ... })
activate DB
Service -> DB : tx.payment.create({\n  bookingId, amount, method: 'CASH', status: 'PAID', paidAt: now\n})
Service -> DB : tx.paymentTransaction.create({\n  paymentId, amount, status: 'VERIFIED', providerCode: 'CASH'\n})
Service -> DB : tx.financialLedger.create({\n  businessId, branchId, bookingId, type: 'PAYMENT_RECEIVED',\n  direction: 'CREDIT', amount, createdBy: user.id\n})
Service -> DB : tx.invoice.create({\n  invoiceNumber, bookingId, totalAmount, status: 'PAID'\n})
Service -> DB : tx.booking.update({\n  where: { id: bookingId },\n  data: { paymentStatus: 'PAID' }\n})
DB --> Service : Giao dịch Thanh toán Commit thành công
deactivate DB

Service -> WsGateway : emit('payment:success', { bookingId, amount })
Service --> Controller : Payment response (status: 'PAID', invoiceId)
deactivate Service
Controller --> Web : 201 Created (status: 'PAID')
deactivate Controller
Web --> Cashier : In hóa đơn & hoàn tất thanh toán tiền mặt

== 2. Chuyển khoản Ngân hàng Thủ công (Manual Bank Transfer) ==
Cashier -> Web : Chọn "Chuyển khoản (BANK_TRANSFER)", hiển thị mã QR & số tài khoản
Cashier -> Web : Tạo lệnh chờ thanh toán chuyển khoản
Web -> Controller : POST /api/v1/payments\nBody: { bookingId, amount, method: 'BANK_TRANSFER' }
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : createPayment(...)
activate Service
Service -> Registry : resolve('BANK_TRANSFER')
activate Registry
Registry --> Service : ManualBankTransferAdapter (requiresManualVerification: true)
deactivate Registry

Service -> DB : withSerializableTransaction(async (tx) => {\n  tx.payment.create({ status: 'PENDING' }),\n  tx.paymentTransaction.create({ status: 'PENDING', providerCode: 'MANUAL_BANK' })\n})
activate DB
DB --> Service : Payment created (PENDING, transactionId)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller : Payment pending
deactivate Service
Controller --> Web : 201 Created (status: 'PENDING', requiresVerification: true)
deactivate Controller
Web --> Cashier : Hiển thị trạng thái "Chờ khách chuyển khoản"

Cashier -> Web : Đối soát App ngân hàng thấy tiền đã vào -> Bấm "Xác nhận đã nhận tiền"
Web -> Controller : POST /api/v1/payments/transactions/{txId}/verify\nBody: { referenceCode: "MB123456", note: "Khách chuyển đúng cú pháp" }
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : verifyTransaction(txId, verifyDto, user)
activate Service

Service -> DB : withSerializableTransaction(async (tx) => {\n  tx.paymentTransaction.update({ where: { id: txId }, data: { status: 'VERIFIED', verifiedAt: now, verifiedById: user.id } }),\n  tx.payment.update({ data: { status: 'PAID', paidAt: now } }),\n  tx.financialLedger.create({\n    type: 'PAYMENT_RECEIVED', direction: 'CREDIT', amount,\n    referenceNumber: referenceCode\n  }),\n  tx.invoice.create({ status: 'PAID' }),\n  tx.booking.update({ data: { paymentStatus: 'PAID' } })\n})
activate DB
DB --> Service : Transaction verified & Ledger created
deactivate DB

Service -> WsGateway : emit('payment:verified', { bookingId })
Service --> Controller : Verified transaction DTO
deactivate Service
Controller --> Web : 200 OK (Thanh toán hoàn tất)
deactivate Controller
Web --> Cashier : Cập nhật trạng thái "Đã thanh toán thành công"

@enduml
